# Local `act` testing scratch — created ad hoc while iterating on an action,
# never committed. .github/test-fixtures/ is the one committed exception.
.test-fixture/

# Fixture-generated deps, not part of the fixture itself.
.github/test-fixtures/**/node_modules/
.github/test-fixtures/**/.venv/

# Compiled binaries left behind by local `go build`/`go test` runs against a Go fixture. Scoped
# one level INSIDE a fixture directory (`*/`, not `**/`): `**/*-broken` also matches the
# `*-broken` fixture directories themselves, which silently excludes a whole fixture from both
# `git add` and act's container copy — a self-test then passes because the action failed to find
# its fixture at all, rather than because the gate it is testing fired.
.github/test-fixtures/*/*-test-fixture*
.github/test-fixtures/*/*-broken

# Local agent/editor settings. Nothing here is shared.
.claude/

# Audit-sweep findings buffer, never committed.
FINDINGS.jsonl
